ate":"2026-11-20","zh":"由於人工智慧估值擔憂，Arista Networks 股價下跌 10%"},{"title":"Arista Networks (ANET) Stock Price Prediction: Rally meets mixed tape after strong Q3 growth and fresh analyst upgrades","src":"Blockchain News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQTDZDNm1NQXlFdEk2Qmh6a1FsU3BWR2Rndkl5WDl1ZEh2WHEteHlvd0FoaHNOWmN1ZUlZNGhuQ01DVkVBbnl2eXh2TkJtUmtscmxuRU5IVGE3OVdoOHZGdEZyOFJvbGZkVTdpNGRWRTktVWJIalFWLTR5R2VCbVpRVUdGQllRSGxHa0ZPam4wOHJFa0dHeG5iQXpCNA?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"Arista Networks (ANET) 股價預測：第三季強勁成長與新分析師上調評等後，漲勢與漲跌互現"},{"title":"Arista Networks Inc Stock (ANET) Moved Down by 4.90% on Nov 13: What Investors Need To Know","src":"TradingKey","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOdUhVRl91VThhSEs1eTNqMThaNV9vSVZpVWRQYjZYS0VEZm5XQURZMnhNOE1lWi1NNkI5N0ZaWmthNnlpMGdiaHFfWVRjZXBhZ2YtVnJ1czhnZThPWWh4VWhJSXlFT2NtWTB0UFJSRzNhc3QycDQyaXNOMnhxaG5pS1hJOThuSlhGNko4?oc=5","date":"2026-11-13","zh":"Arista Networks Inc 股票 (ANET) 11 月 13 日下跌 4.90%：投資者需要了解什麼"},{"title":"Arista Networks (ANET) Guides Higher, Is The Stock Overvalued Following Earnings?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOS1dwM0ZDNUd2X2hWWnhvalFOSUtELUhkVENQdkx0YVFwNmk4alJNX240UTh4UVhFVDVyQUhES25ETDVmQldFNktHLXFnTkpKeGdvN2pKb05WWHJicVpuLUNUVExERWludENJa2tRNWZuZEl0QndWd1hUWXpERUcyY09tSkRTX2c0NTMxWGFiOGJfZFZtaC1pc19EWUxybXVC?oc=5","date":"2026-11-12","zh":"Arista Networks (ANET) 指引走高，獲利後股票是否被高估？"},{"title":"Arista Networks Stock Is AI Networking Demand Still Driving Strong Earnings","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-12","zh":"Arista Networks 股票人工智慧網路需求仍在推動強勁獲利"},{"title":"Arista Networks (ANET) Stock Price Prediction: AI-driven revenue beat lifts the tape, but momentum remains mixed","src":"Blockchain News","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxObE5KVDh1dERmOWc0bUZTZHNKYmhodW9QUWJMR0VrVDczYm5Xb18wellGNHpkNy1jMS1wcVdVVjB6T1lWWkJ4el9LODhGdDFLSk5iMnRxcFFDaFFKNzdBak1KdmVodXgtVl9kd0FCYnd0eFBMai1hc2p3MVFxSEo4WkRnY0pWUTNiOFVPUUNPbERveV9mdkxR?oc=5","date":"2026-11-09","zh":"Arista Networks (ANET) 股價預測：人工智慧驅動的營收成長提振大盤，但動能仍喜憂參半"},{"title":"Is Arista Networks (ANET) Undervalued On Record Q3 Results And Q4 Guidance?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-06","zh":"根據記錄的第三季業績和第四季指導，Arista Networks (ANET) 是否被低估？"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-17","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1596532/000159653226000013/anet-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"In a world where data is increasingly a precious commodity and competitive differentiator, Arista was founded to enable our customers to access all their centers of data in the quickest, most reliable, and secure manner. Over the last two decades, we have emerged as an industry leader, delivering data-driven, client-to-cloud networking-as-a-service. Our \"Centers of Data\" strategy is a fundamental pivot from legacy networking approaches that create incongruent silos to a unified, data-driven approach in which the network is a service that interconnects four primary domains: AI Centers, Data Centers, Campus Centers, and WAN Centers. Anchored by Arista's state-oriented Extensible Operating System (EOS) and Network Data Lake (NetDL), our network-as-a-service platform delivers a seamless, consolidated networking experience regardless of data location.","zh":"在資料日益成為寶貴商品和競爭優勢的世界中，Arista 的成立是為了使我們的客戶能夠以最快速、最可靠和安全的方式存取其所有資料中心。在過去的二十年中，我們已成為行業領導者，提供數據驅動的客戶端到雲端網路即服務。我們的「資料中心」策略是一個基本支點，從創建不一致孤島的傳統網路方法轉向統一的資料驅動方法，其中網路是互連四個主要領域的服務：人工智慧中心、資料中心、園區中心和廣域網路中心。我們的網路即服務平台以 Arista 面向狀態的可擴展作業系統 (EOS) 和網路資料湖 (NetDL) 為基礎，無論資料位置為何，都能提供無縫、整合的網路體驗。"},{"en":"This strategy and differentiation have also allowed us to deliver our comprehensive suite of products, services, and technologies to a global customer base segmented into three primary categories: Cloud and AI Titans, AI and Specialty Providers, and Enterprise. Market research confirms that we continue to be a leader in high-speed Ethernet switching.","zh":"這項策略和差異化也使我們能夠向全球客戶群提供全面的產品、服務和技術套件，這些客戶群分為三個主要類別：雲端和人工智慧巨頭、人工智慧和專業提供者以及企業。市場研究證實，我們仍然是高速乙太網路交換領域的領導者。"},{"en":"In the modern competitive landscape, the ability to access, manipulate, and leverage data is fundamental to an organization's growth and viability. This is especially true in the era of Large Language Models (LLMs), agentic AI, and physical AI, where data has evolved from a byproduct of operations into the primary engine of intelligence and autonomy. Consequently, the network has matured beyond traditional \"IT infrastructure\" to become the spine or central nervous system. It serves as the critical conduit through which data flows from cloud and edge environments to the AI models that drive decision-making. This heightened dependency on real-time data movement underscores the necessity for a network architecture defined by unprecedented scale, availability, predictable performance, and open programmability. Operational simplicity and robust security are essential to ensure the business ca","zh":"在現代競爭格局中，存取、操作和利用數據的能力對於組織的成長和生存能力至關重要。在大型語言模型（LLM）、代理人工智慧和物理人工智慧時代尤其如此，數據已經從操作的副產品發展成為智慧和自治的主要引擎。因此，網路已經成熟，超越了傳統的“IT基礎設施”，成為脊柱或中樞神經系統。它是資料從雲端和邊緣環境流向驅動決策的人工智慧模型的關鍵管道。這種對即時資料移動的高度依賴強調了由前所未有的規模、可用性、可預測效能和開放可程式性定義的網路架構的必要性。操作簡單性和強大的安全性對於確保業務安全至關重要"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our customers include large cloud customers or Cloud and AI Titans, other internet and service providers, including specialty and AI Neoclouds, and a wide breadth of enterprise customers, including financial services organizations and government agencies. We continue to diversify the types of enterprise customers we serve and have expanded our presence across a wide spectrum of industries, including media and entertainment, healthcare, oil and gas, education, manufacturing and industrial sectors, among others. Two of our customers accounted for more than 10% of our sales for the year ended December 31, 2025. Sales to these two customers represented 26% and 16% of our total revenue for the year ended December 31, 2025, respectively.","zh":"我們的客戶包括大型雲端客戶或雲端和人工智慧巨頭、其他網路和服務供應商，包括專業和人工智慧 Neoclouds，以及廣泛的企業客戶，包括金融服務組織和政府機構。我們繼續使我們服務的企業客戶類型多樣化，並將我們的業務擴展到廣泛的行業，包括媒體和娛樂、醫療保健、石油和天然氣、教育、製造和工業部門等。我們的兩位客戶占我們截至2025年12月31日止年度銷售額的10%以上。對這兩位客戶的銷售額分別占我們截至2025年12月31日止年度總收入的26%和16%。"},{"en":"We market and sell our products through our direct sales force and in partnership with our channel partners, including distributors, value-added resellers, systems integrators and original equipment manufacturer (\"OEM\") partners. We also partner with various technology companies to sell our products. To facilitate channel coordination and increase productivity, we have established the Arista Partner Program, designed to engage partners who provide value-added services and extend our reach into the marketplace. Authorized training partners deliver technical training to our channel partners and end customers. Our partners typically receive an order from an end customer before placing an order with us, and we verify the end customer's identification before accepting such orders. Our partners generally do not stock inventory received from us.","zh":"我們透過直銷團隊並與通路合作夥伴（包括經銷商、加值經銷商、系統整合商和原始設備製造商（「OEM」）合作夥伴）合作行銷和銷售我們的產品。我們也與各種科技公司合作銷售我們的產品。為了促進通路協調並提高生產力，我們建立了 Arista 合作夥伴計劃，旨在吸引提供增值服務並擴大我們的市場影響力的合作夥伴。授權培訓合作夥伴為我們的通路合作夥伴和最終客戶提供技術培訓。我們的合作夥伴通常會在向我們下訂單之前收到最終客戶的訂單，並且我們在接受此類訂單之前會驗證最終客戶的身份。我們的合作夥伴通常不會庫存從我們這裡收到的庫存。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets in which we participate are highly competitive and characterized by rapidly transforming technology, changing end-customer needs, evolving industry standards, frequent introductions of new products and services and industry consolidation. We expect competition to intensify in the future as the market for cloud and AI networking expands and existing competitors and new market entrants introduce new products or enhance existing products.","zh":"我們參與的市場競爭激烈，其特點是技術快速變革、最終客戶需求不斷變化、行業標準不斷發展、新產品和服務頻繁推出以及行業整合。我們預計，隨著雲端和人工智慧網路市場的擴大以及現有競爭對手和新市場進入者推出新產品或增強現有產品，未來競爭將加劇。"},{"en":"The data center and campus networking markets have historically been dominated by Cisco, with competition also coming from other large network equipment and system vendors, including Dell/EMC, Extreme Networks, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, Huawei, Juniper Networks, Nvidia, and white box networking vendors that utilize open-source operating systems. Most of our competitors and some strategic alliance partners have made acquisitions and/or have entered into or extended partnerships or other strategic relationships to offer more comprehensive product lines, including cloud networking solutions. For example, Broadcom has acquired VMware, Hewlett Packard Enterprise has acquired Juniper Networks and Nvidia has made significant investments in several AI Neoclouds. We often see that these types of acquisitions and strategic investments are used to influence buying decisions rather than allowing f","zh":"資料中心和園區網路市場歷來由思科主導，競爭也來自其他大型網路設備和系統供應商，包括戴爾/EMC、極進網路、惠普企業、華為、瞻博網路、Nvidia以及使用開源作業系統的白盒網路供應商。我們的大多數競爭對手和一些策略聯盟合作夥伴都進行了收購和/或建立或擴展了合作夥伴關係或其他策略關係，以提供更全面的產品線，包括雲端網路解決方案。例如，Broadcom 收購了 VMware，Hewlett Packard Enterprise 收購了 Juniper Networks，Nvidia 對多個 AI Neocloud 進行了大量投資。我們經常看到這些類型的收購和策略投資被用來影響購買決策，而不是允許購買決策。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":7576900000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":1428800000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":9005700000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":7122100000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":7063800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":1070300000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":813300000,"zh":"亞太"}],"total":9005700000}},"peers":["VRT","PANW","NOW","CRWD","LRCX"]}}